(2) The application for the renewal of a body art studio permit shall include:
a. A complete description of all body art services that will be provided at the studio;
b. The full or legal name under which the body art studio is operated;
c. The address of the body art studio;
d. If the owner leases the location, the name and current address of the landlord;
e. The name and current home address of the owner; if the owner of the body art studio is a partnership, the names and addresses of all partners; if the owner is a corporation, the date and place of incorporation and the name and address of its registered agent in the state; or if the owner is any other type of association, the names of the principals of the association;
f. An updated list containing the full names and home addresses of all current employees and staff who will be working in the body art studio;
g. A copy of the written statement of policies and procedures of the body art studio in accordance with section 23-6 of these rules;
h. An acknowledgement signed by the owner acknowledging that the owner has read and understands these rules; and
i. Such other information as may be deemed necessary by the board of health.
(Ord. No. 2024-637, 9-9-2024)

